  Slug: double-spellstrike
  DisplayName: Double Spellstrike
  IconPath: icons/skills/melee/blade-tips-double-blue.webp
  Description: You can extend the magic of spells you store with Spellstrike. After
    you make a Spellstrike with a spell cast from a spell slot, you retain an echo
    of the spell, stored in your body. The next time you Spellstrike, you can cast
    the same spell again without expending a spell slot. If you choose to cast a
    different spell with Spellstrike, or you go 1 minute without using the stored
    spell, the stored spell dissipates harmlessly.
